        "day": 1,
        "vid": "elif_demir",
        "kcal": 800,
        "line": "🍽️ Thin day. Your bowl stays half-full — the other half goes to Elif, who's been quiet about being hungry."
      },
      {
        "day": 177,
        "vid": "nino_kapanadze",
        "kcal": 1203,
        "line": "🍽️ You push half your bowl across the fire to Nino — 'eat. You need it more than I do.' Nino doesn't argue. The bowl comes back scraped clean."
      },
      {
        "day": 178,
        "vid": "amina_diallo",
        "kcal": 1120,
        "line": "🍽️ The bins are thin, and Amina looks it. You set your second half in front of Amina. 'Eat,' you say. Amina eats like someone making up for days."
      },
      {
        "day": 179,
        "vid": "amina_diallo",
        "kcal": 1274,
        "line": "🍽️ Half your share tonight. You hand the rest to Amina, who takes it with both hands and doesn't say a word until it's gone."
      }
    ]
